WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.250
A shepherd boy faces a giant with a sling.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.000
The battle is the LORD's, he says.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.320
Later, in a cave at En-gedi,
he spares the king hunting him.

4
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:14.030
But as king, David takes
Uriah's wife, Bathsheba,

5
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.540
and sends Uriah to his death.

6
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.820
A prophet tells of a rich man who
steals a poor man's only lamb.

7
00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.150
Then: You are the man!

8
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.940
So why is he still held up as the model?

9
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:28.920
In this mission, you'll
follow his rise and reign,

10
00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:31.060
from Goliath to Jerusalem.

11
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:34.890
Then you'll test God's promise
that his house would stand forever,

12
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.990
and a psalm that protests.

13
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.830
Your mission: find out why
this king is still the model.
